<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for your interest in Arizona State University. I have included some information below to help you with the application process.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Your first step is to review our <a href="https://students.asu.edu/freshman/requirements">freshman admission requirements</a> online. Some majors have additional requirements, which can be viewed by searching for your major on <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/programs/t5/">degree search</a>.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Once you’re ready, follow the application steps below:</font></div><div><ol><li><a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/uga_admissionsapp/" style="font-size: 12pt;">Apply for admission</a></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Pay the application fee online</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Request to have your ACT or SAT scores sent directly to ASU from ACT or College Board</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Request official transcripts from each educational institution attended be sent directly to ASU Admission Services*</span></li></ol><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Once we receive all materials, your file will be reviewed for admission. The review process may take four to six weeks.</span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">*If you self-report your grades, you do not need to submit an official transcript to receive your admission decision. An official transcript will be required once you graduate from high school.</span></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">After you apply to ASU, you’ll receive an email and a letter containing your ASURITE UserID and activation code. Follow the instructions to activate your login for <a href="http://my.asu.edu/">My ASU</a>. You will be able to track your admission status and take care of any <b>Priority Tasks</b>&nbsp;needed to complete your application.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">If you have any questions, let me know and I will be happy to help.</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>